# Release signing secrets — NEVER committed. The release keystore + passwords live only in
# GitHub Actions secrets (KEYSTORE_BASE64, ALPDROID_* — see .github/workflows) and, for local
# release builds, an untracked keystore.properties. History still contains a previously
# committed key: rotate the app signing key before publishing this repo.
